1. Intro to pandas

it is one most popular library for data analysis and manipulation
it used in statistics , economics , web analytics , advertising and many other fields.



The following are the features of the Pandas Library:

Analyze Data
Manipulate Data
Columns can be inserted and deleted from DataFrame
Group the rows/ columns of a DataFrame/ Series
Plotting is possible
Read CSV/ JSON
Fix the inaccurate data
Clean the Data completely
Easy to handle the missing data in the form: NaN, NA, or NaT

what is pandas data frame :
The Pandas DataFrame is a Two-dimensional tabular data structure i.e. table with rows and columns. Before moving further, we’ve prepared a video tutorial to learn what is a DataFrame in Pandas and how to create:


